	(text_box "PTN5150AHXMP\n\nADR/CON_DET (Pin 5):\n========================\n- VDD with 10k: I2C Enabled with ADDR bit 6 equal to 1, I2C Address 0x7A\n- Mid or floating: Pin 6/7/8 configured as OUT1/2/3 in non-I2C mode\n- GND with 10k: I2C Enabled with ADDR bit 6 equal to 0, I2C Address 0x3A\n\nPORT (Pin 3):\n========================\n- VDD: DFP mode (Rp = 80uA power default for non-I2C mode).\n- Mid (or floating): DRP mode\n- GND: UFP mode\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 88.9 0)
		(size 58.42 20.5101)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
